   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Relative clauses with «che»",
     "texto": [
      "**Che** does not change for gender or number. It can be the subject of the clause (**il ragazzo che parla**, the boy who speaks) or the direct object (**il libro che leggo**, the book that I read).",
      "Check who performs the action: in **la persona che conosco**, I know the person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Who or someone",
     "texto": [
      "**Qualcuno che** (someone who), **Un animale che abita qui** (an animal that lives here).",
      "The verb in the clause with «che» is conjugated according to who performs the action."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
